        {
          "lang": "zh-TW",
          "lang_word": "icy",
          "definition": "a. 冰冷的、結冰的；冷淡的、不友善的"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "The driver slowed down because the road was icy and dangerous.",
