            "icy"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "駕駛放慢了速度，因為路面結冰又危險。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "The receptionist gave the visitor an icier welcome than the previous guests had received.",
          "highlight": [
            "icier"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "接待員給這名訪客的招呼，比之前幾位客人得到的更冷淡。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "January was the iciest month on record, with temperatures dropping well below zero.",
          "highlight": [
            "iciest"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "一月是有紀錄以來最冰冷的一個月，氣溫遠降至零度以下。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "synonyms": [
